--
Regression for LinkedList model.

Verifies the basic LinkedList operations (size, isEmpty, add,
get, getFirst, getLast) using JBMC's core-models.jar
LinkedList implementation.

Note: this test deliberately does NOT exercise removeFirst /
addFirst because the model implements them via in-place
System.arraycopy on the backing array, which JBMC's array
model does not handle correctly with overlapping ranges.
That limitation is tracked in REVIEW-PRE-PUSH.md.
